		{"id":"9d210a6c0050b44a","type":"text","text":"Character Ideas\n- Character name and backstory could be a parallel to celtic mythology: \n\t- Name: could recite to mythology, some name ideas: \n\t\t- Setante (from the story of cu chulainn who uses a heavy iron weapon to kill evil things like fairies and such, iron needs to be a big part of the story to \"defeat\" enemies)\n\t\t- Nechtan (follows a story of a guy who carried a sword of light? didnt read too much into it but could make this into a parallel somehow)\n\t\t- Or basic story of a teenager or young guy struggling in college/school going through mental health with some name like luke or something\n\t\t\t- Could also twist up a celtic name to sound more modern but have an origin to the mythology\n- Overall personality ideas: \n\t- Introverted/nerdy and into fiction related to celtic mythology? \n\t- Dealing with depression, could be psychotic? \n\t- Internally lost, dealing with family matters/school/whatever else in life making him wanting to escape in his fiction through books/games/etc (maybe thats how he gets transported into the realm?)","x":292,"y":-275,"width":648,"height":555},
